Package: audialsynth
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Audial Synth - wavetable synthesizer with sample resynthesis
 Audial Synth is a MIDI enabled polyphonic wavetable synthesizer with an easy
 to use parameter modulation system and real-time graphical feedback. Its
 Resynth panel sends a short sample to the Audial API and loads the editable
 patch that comes back.
